  "notes": "Describes a consist of 4 coupled S700 vehicles. Per-vehicle figures (Siemens data sheet): length over coupler 28.742 m, empty weight 46.5 t, 61 seats, approx. 235 total passengers at 6 p/m2, 4 doors per side, 4 wheelchair spaces, traction 4 x 130 kW, maximum operational speed 88 km/h, service acceleration and deceleration 1.34 m/s2, emergency braking 2.18-2.2 m/s2, minimum turning radius 25 m. Consist totals (length, weight, seats, total, doors, wheelchair spaces, power) are per-vehicle values multiplied by 4 (marked derived); width, height, speeds and rates are per vehicle. Capacity is per consist; per vehicle it is 235. The data sheet says the vehicles can run in multiple-unit consists of up to four. Each vehicle is double-articulated (three sections, Bo'+2'+Bo'). Floor height 396 mm is the low-floor centre (356 mm threshold, 670 mm high-floor section over the trucks). Maximum allowable speed 95 km/h. A four-vehicle consist is the maximum the data sheet names.",
